  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "arrival",
      "name": "01 · 雨夜来信",
      "notes": "建立场景 → 对话 → 第一次选择",
      "next": "",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "n_6c869fae-f047-48e6-a762-09a1b4796906",
          "type": "background",
          "asset": "",
          "color": "#203b4b",
          "transition": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_2dc2997a-345b-4917-9721-9fa35c63c8cb",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "雨滴在车站的屋檐下连成一条线。\n最后一班列车已经离开，你却在长椅上发现了一封信。"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_cdc1a55f-82f2-418f-bf8c-cc33cc90a564",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "lin",
          "text": "你也在等一个不会来的人吗？",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_3cfd1b70-cbff-4aea-9d2a-b0fc6eb13d7c",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "you",
          "text": "我只是……不太想回去。",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_fe1fa05b-7369-4014-a14b-c791ec799a2a",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "lin",
          "text": "那就陪我等到雨停吧。也许这封信，正好是写给你的。",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_3dde637c-671e-4351-8e63-764b29b507fb",
          "type": "choice",
          "text": "她把信递了过来。",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "接过信，听听她的故事",
              "target": "letter",
              "condition": null
            },
            {
              "text": "把伞递给她，一起离开车站",
              "target": "umbrella",
              "condition": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "letter",
      "name": "02 · 未寄出的信",
      "notes": "示例：增加好感度，跳转公共场景",
      "next": "after",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "n_2aa0e411-5648-45b8-ac1d-cf1edf0cc178",
          "type": "set",
          "variable": "trust",
          "op": "+=",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "n_072bc5f3-0229-4aa3-a087-251ae420b2d1",
          "type": "background",
          "asset": "",
          "color": "#304353",
          "transition": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_63af7d6a-8e81-4a9e-a7df-db8af66a2115",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "you",
          "text": "信封上没有名字。你怎么知道是给我的？",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_1652235a-d0ea-4f80-8e9b-1443c9c074a9",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "lin",
          "text": "因为每一个在这里停下来的人，都需要有人说一句——",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_09026ed3-87c0-4cfc-b29a-35ab2679709e",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "lin",
          "text": "「你已经走得很远了，休息一下也没关系。」",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_72b6061f-c013-46c5-8592-7322df2d2f22",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你把信小心地折好。雨声似乎没有那么冷了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "umbrella",
      "name": "03 · 同一把伞",
      "notes": "另一条路径，汇入公共场景",
      "next": "after",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "n_49fcc960-8b1e-429e-874f-faa52378bb19",
          "type": "set",
          "variable": "trust",
          "op": "+=",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "n_eeb33fa6-b0b8-4af4-a895-9b9c43717322",
          "type": "background",
          "asset": "",
          "color": "#243f44",
          "transition": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_2d3dc2b0-8f1d-47f8-b836-ea391d4e6b84",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "you",
          "text": "不用等雨停。我们可以一起走。",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_d9226ab5-c6c7-421c-ae4a-a85aa817a49b",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "lin",
          "text": "……你总是这样替陌生人做决定吗？",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_cc7eb04b-d042-4064-a543-70c36634abd2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "you",
          "text": "只在我刚好带了伞的时候。",
          "voice": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "n_3b602a13-7289-404a-b816-9be7e2c29ebe",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她笑了。两个人的脚步声，在雨里慢慢重叠。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "after",
      "name": "04 · 雨停之前",
